('Terra Grand Residential Plots', 'Sector 35, Sohna', 'Premium residential plots in a gated community with wide roads, underground utilities, and landscaped parks. Ideal for building your dream home with complete freedom of design.', '₹45,00,000', 'plot', 'available', '180 sq.yd.', NULL, NULL, 'https://images.pexels.com/photos/1396122/pexels-photo-1396122.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200', ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/259588/pexels-photo-259588.jpeg', 'https://images.pexels.com/photos/1115803/pexels-photo-1115803.jpeg'], ARRAY['Gated Community', 'Wide Roads (60 ft)', 'Underground Utilities', 'Parks & Green Areas', 'Corner Plots Available', 'Boundary Wall', 'Street Lighting', 'Water Supply', 'Electricity', 'Sewage Lines'], 4500000, 180, 28.2567, 77.0723, 'Terra Grand, Sector 35, Sohna', 'HRERA-SOH-123-2022', 'Terra Group', '2025-03-31', true, 25000, true, 'East', NULL, NULL, 42),

